(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-44","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["入冬后，大家用三天清沟[[eradicate|根除]]一段旧淤堵。这是顾峦安排给学徒的[[errand|差事]]，不考他们能否从险井[[escape|逃出]]，也不许诺谁的修为[[everlasting|永恒]]。每个口有普通[[exit|出口]]，坏一闸还能经缓冲槽分水。沈砚觉得这样的冬晨[[extraordinarily|格外]]安静。孩子要听英雄[[fable|故事]]，他讲那个停闸、承认自己量错的人，故事听不听是[[optional|可自选的]]，守水检查却不能省。一次[[false|错误的]]旧记录被红线更正，原页仍留。季禾重看[[fastener|紧固件]]，让下一班自己试，他终于可以放心去探那位正在学拄杖的朋友。","赶羊人的[[father-in-law|岳父]]送来婚期消息，因路通粮足，亲事得以按[[favorable|合适的]]时日举行。顾峦做了孩子们[[favorite|最喜欢的]]木水车，没自称[[fearless|无畏的]]英雄。顾衡也不需永当[[fighter|斗士]]，用[[firmness|坚定]]的态度拦一次越量取水便够。沈砚手能缓缓握成[[fist|拳]]，尚不能照旧舞剑，却能[[fix|修好]]门闩。山下的[[flag|信号旗]]与钟声对应，旧漆一[[flake|薄片]]落在石上，顾峦捡起清走，不让它又入水。罗清到场祝新婚，却不愿因此略过当天的病者复看，先办完自己的事再喝那碗喜粥。","青年们[[follow|遵照]]水尺分工，不必做谁的[[follower|追随者]]。周伯很[[fond|喜欢]]孙女认字后的笑，她在船[[fore|前部]]看山影，学会说哪边是上游。夜里水会[[freeze|结冰]]，池边保留[[fresh|清洁的]]备用水，晨风[[freshen|使精神振作]]。顾衡将不用的私台门[[shut|关上]]，孩子觉得木闸吱呀声很[[funny|有趣]]，自己也能转。他向三家发了一份[[general|全面的]]冬季检查单，要求慢开慢停。许庭的新货单照两个码头走，一家迟货，另一家仍可送，不再用独占的路逼人把水押出去。","罗清说话还是[[gentle|温和]]，将沈砚的手[[gently|轻轻地]]放回桌上：恢复要慢。他重学修行，先学感受自己呼吸，不急着凭[[alchemy|炼丹术]]追补三年。顾峦把闸工[[glossary|术语说明]]放在工具棚，配的只是易认图，不写谁是[[god|神]]，也不把母亲画成[[goddess|女神]]。旧看守曾被工人叫作[[gorilla|蛮横的恶汉]]，如今按责清池，仍能拒绝超出自己份额的无偿劳动。夜雾不是必须惧怕的[[omen|预兆]]。周伯作为[[grandfather|祖父]]帮孙女收好[[grandmother|祖母]]绣的手帕，孩子自己带着它出门，知道老人晚间会回家，不再守着空窗等一盏灯。","沈砚用[[graphite|石墨]]笔记新苗，不以[[greed|贪求]]长生压过别人饮水。来自孤城的人在钟前[[greet|问候]]罗清，说伤友能沿院走半圈；仍会痛，医费仍按册付。许庭看见冬路泥深会[[grumble|抱怨]]，牛在轭中[[grunt|哼气]]，他也必须给它们留休息。突然落几粒[[hail|冰雹]]，顾衡令暂缓一班，没人拿开闸误时罚值守者。喜宴的[[ham|火腿]]切成小片，沈砚惊于普通人相坐的[[wonder|奇妙]]，周伯孙女展开旧[[handkerchief|手帕]]擦桌。房屋并不[[handsome|华美]]，桌边却有能认清数目、不必求人得水的人。","晚饭后，沈砚回到药田。母亲的旧账与他自己的错误都留在钟楼，不靠删字获得安稳；银扣两半仍钉在一起，再不能开门。他听见第一声，停取；第二声，清槽；第三声，水下山。旗号越过盐路，城里的人照同一张公开图守着自己的口，声音不到的地方也有人互看尺。罗清从医馆回来，在田边停了片刻，问明早先做什么。他说先记水位，再练手。她说那我先看病者，晚些一起去量下游。细流经过他们，向更远的人家走去。钟声落定，水声还长。"],"en":["Before winter they began to [[eradicate|eradicate]] old blockage. Luan’s apprentice [[errand|errand]] required no dangerous [[escape|escape]] and promised no [[everlasting|everlasting]] power. Ordinary [[exit|exit]] channels backed up gates. Shen found the morning [[extraordinarily|extraordinarily]] quiet. Asked for a hero [[fable|fable]], he told of stopping and admitting measurement errors. Listening was [[optional|optional]], inspection was not. A [[false|false]] record was corrected without destroying its page. Ji checked a [[fastener|fastener]], then could visit his friend learning to use a crutch.","The shepherd’s [[father-in-law|father-in-law]] confirmed a [[favorable|favorable]] wedding date now that food routes worked. Luan built children’s [[favorite|favorite]] water toy without claiming to be [[fearless|fearless]]. Gu need not always be a [[fighter|fighter]], only use [[firmness|firmness]] against excessive drawing. Shen could make a [[fist|fist]] slowly and [[fix|fix]] a latch, though not wield his former sword. A [[flag|flag]] matched each bell. Luan removed a paint [[flake|flake]] before it entered water. Luo completed patient reviews before wedding porridge.","Youths would [[follow|follow]] rulers, not become someone’s [[follower|follower]]. [[fond|Fond]] of his granddaughter’s reading, Zhou watched her at the boat’s [[fore|fore]]. When water would [[freeze|freeze]], [[fresh|fresh]] reserves remained. Wind could [[freshen|freshen]] spirits. Gu would [[shut|shut]] the disused platform and send a [[general|general]] winter checklist. Children found gate squeaks [[funny|funny]]. Xu used two landings; one delay could no longer force villages to mortgage water for the only route.","In a [[gentle|gentle]] voice, Luo placed Shen’s hand [[gently|gently]] down: recovery needed time. He resumed cultivation without using [[alchemy|alchemy]] to reclaim years overnight. Luan’s [[glossary|glossary]] of gate terms had simple diagrams, no [[god|god]] or mother as [[goddess|goddess]]. A former guard called a [[gorilla|gorilla]] by workers now performed assigned pool work and retained limits against unpaid demands. Mist was no automatic [[omen|omen]]. As a [[grandfather|grandfather]], Zhou helped preserve a [[grandmother|grandmother]]’s embroidered cloth. His granddaughter no longer waited at an empty window for proof he was alive.","With [[graphite|graphite]], Shen recorded seedlings without [[greed|greed]] for longevity over drinking rights. City visitors came to [[greet|greet]] Luo: Ji’s friend could walk half the courtyard, with continued pain and funded care. Xu could [[grumble|grumble]] about mud while oxen would [[grunt|grunt]], but still owed rest. Falling [[hail|hail]] paused a shift without punishment. Wedding [[ham|ham]] was shared. Shen felt the [[wonder|wonder]] of ordinary company. Zhou’s granddaughter wiped the table with a [[handkerchief|handkerchief]]. The house was not [[handsome|handsome]], but its people could read accounts and draw their share without pleading.","After supper Shen returned to his field. His mother’s account and his own errors remained public; peace required no erased words. The two clasp halves could open nothing. One bell stopped drawing, two called cleaning, three let water down. Flags crossed the salt road. People beyond hearing used the same map and mutual measurements. Luo paused beside him, asking about tomorrow. First water levels, then his hand, he said. She would see patients, then join him downstream. The current passed towards other homes. The bells ceased; the water continued."]});
